# `pipeline.update_status`

Advance a pipeline run's lifecycle/gate state (the agent's own run).

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.runtime.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `pipeline_run_id` | `string` | yes |
| `status` | `string` | yes |
| `worktree` | `string?` | no |
| `pid` | `number?` | no |
| `gate_agent` | `string?` | no |
| `blocker` | `string?` | no |
| `error` | `string?` | no |

## Returns

Status JSON (the mutation result).

## Invoke

```
ship ops call pipeline.update_status --json '{ "pipeline_run_id": "", "status": "" }'
```

Kind: command.
